      "name": "Street Network Changes (Historical)",
      "description": "This file includes the locations and nature of street closures, one-way conversions and reversals, and two-way conversions within the five boroughs of New York City. It does NOT contain information on closures or temporary re-routing due to construction or special events. NYCDOT estimates these changes occur less than once a month.  The New York City Department of Transportation makes no warranty of accuracy or completeness of this data. Drivers should always comply with signals, signs and other existing regulations.",
      "attribution": "Department of Transportation (DOT)",
